      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_d4a33983",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: prize_the_real_not_the_imitation; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The meme uses the visual metaphor of real gold versus fool's gold to categorize people based on gender identity. It explicitly labels 'women as women' as 'real gold' while labeling 'tranny men as 'women'' as 'fool's gold,' which is a derogatory and harmful characterization. This is a hateful meme because it directly attacks and devalues a specific group (trans men) based on their gender identity, using a false and offensive analogy to promote discrimination. The intent is to stigmatize and dehumanize trans men by equating their identity with something inferior, thereby reinforcing harmful societal attitudes and potentially inciting prejudice or violence against them.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_57631103"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
