      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "transgender_identity",
      "label": "Transgender Identity",
      "description": "The concept that a person's gender identity may differ from the sex they were assigned at birth. This is the core identity being referenced in the meme's text ('tranny men' as 'women'), which is a derogatory term for transgender men. Understanding this concept is necessary to interpret the meme's target and its harmful implications.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
