      "instance_name": "gender_identity",
      "label": "Gender Identity",
      "description": "The personal, internal sense of one's own gender, which may or may not align with the sex assigned at birth. The meme's entire premise hinges on a binary, essentialist view of gender identity, which is a contested concept in contemporary society and is being used here to devalue transgender identities.",
