      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_19731470",
      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "Hateful Meme Audience",
      "description": "The target community for this meme is individuals who hold prejudiced or discriminatory views toward transgender people, particularly transgender men. The meme is designed to appeal to those who support gender essentialism and the gender binary, and who are likely to use derogatory language such as 'tranny' to dehumanize and stigmatize transgender individuals. The audience is likely to be individuals who are hostile toward transgender rights and who may be influenced by or supportive of anti-transgender rhetoric and conspiracy theories that frame transgender identities as 'imitations' or 'fools' gold.'",
